          "type": "text",
          "s3Beat": 16,
          "camera": {
            "preventDissolve": true,
            "hold": true
          },
          "staging": "La reacción introduce la consecuencia que continuará hacia las ramas; B en mano y A en bolsillo.",
          "who": "alice",
          "text": "I meant a little taller. Not all at once!",
          "readingDurationMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "alice-c3-little-17",
          "type": "text",
          "s3Beat": 17,
          "camera": {
            "preventDissolve": true,
            "hold": true
          },
          "staging": "Cierre hablado, sin espera muda; conserva ambas porciones. S4 aún no se produce.",
          "who": "alice",
          "text": "Perhaps the next lesson is knowing when to stop.",
          "readingDurationMs": 6000
